  "prefLabel": "Eng 403.03 Requirements for Reciprocity",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-01-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 403.03 Requirements for Reciprocity. Licensees who are residents of jurisdictions other than New Hampshire shall meet the continuing professional development or equivalent requirements of their resident jurisdiction. The requirements for the state of New Hampshire shall be satisfied when a non-resident licensee provides evidence of having met the requirements of their resident jurisdiction. If licensees reside in a jurisdiction that has no continuing professional development requirements, the resident shall meet the requirements of the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12, EXPIRED: 1-1-22\n\nNew. #13859, eff 3-26-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/eng300-500.html"
